                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                        "entry_id": "fdca3489-221d-3ed2-986e-fd5f9f4d036d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A county of Shiyan, Hubei, China."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9044cc8f-51c3-4661-aa0e-84fcc9fa9cac",
                                                "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                                "text": "Many valuable medicines are produced in Hupei, particularly in the Shih-nan Prefecture and in the Fang and Hsing-shan districts."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b78549ff-da69-4953-9253-c435c6b1d40b",
                                                "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                                "text": "FANG COUNTY HYDROELECTRICITY--This year the people in Fang County have developed 135 small hydroelectric power stations with a total installed[...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f2f40b1-5e1c-4a60-a657-774930a44079",
                                                "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                                "text": "After parting with his brothers, Wang Yü-yang journeyed on the southwest road and came to a small town nestled in the rural region of Fang County."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e500b1a0-a6e6-42d9-8a47-1b63c72ffbdc",
                                                "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                                "text": "“Its speed was very fast, but it was walking, not running,” Yuan said. As the creature ranged across a mountain in Fang county, bordering the Shennongjia Forestry District, “it walked faster than a human ran”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4d2bb90a-4f3c-4ef3-bf54-eb7e2b173f4a",
                                                "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                                "text": "Hubei Sanxin Biotechnology Co., LTD, located in Fang County, Shiyan City, has developed a series of traditional Chinese medicine [from] Polygonum Cuspidatum, including \"yellow bud stem\" vegetables, resveratrol extract, emodin extract, and crude Polygonum cuspidatum extract and so on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e8ddfc1-bd3f-4189-a89b-af636e176c41",
                                                "sense_id": "467a150b-9d72-3b7f-844f-dd6db4d4ea62",
                                                "text": "Now, the Fang County government is trying “incentives,” according to a statement posted Saturday on its website. People who report their own fevers will receive 1,000 renminbi, the equivalent of $143 — a few days’ salary for the average Hubei resident."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
